</div>

</header>

<section class="sec" id="services" aria-labelledby="s-t">
  <p class="kick" aria-hidden="true">What we do</p>
  <h2 class="h2" id="s-t">Carpentry &amp; building, start to finish</h2>
  <div class="svc">
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">01</p><h3 class="svc__h">Bathrooms</h3><p class="svc__p">Full bathroom renovations — waterproofing, tiling, fixtures and custom cabinetry.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">02</p><h3 class="svc__h">Flooring</h3><p class="svc__p">Timber, hybrid, laminate and tile — supply and install with subfloor prep.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">03</p><h3 class="svc__h">Decks &amp; Pergolas</h3><p class="svc__p">Hardwood and composite decks, roofed and open pergolas, council-compliant builds.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">04</p><h3 class="svc__h">Extensions</h3><p class="svc__p">Room additions and second-storey extensions — structural to finish.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">05</p><h3 class="svc__h">Kitchen Installs</h3><p class="svc__p">Cabinetry install, benchtops, splashbacks and appliance integration.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">06</p><h3 class="svc__h">Doors &amp; Windows</h3><p class="svc__p">Aluminium and timber, sliding, bifold, entry doors and custom sizes.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">07</p><h3 class="svc__h">Cladding</h3><p class="svc__p">Weatherboard, fibre cement, metal and composite — weather-tight detailing.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">08</p><h3 class="svc__h">Property Maintenance</h3><p class="svc__p">Ongoing and reactive repairs, painting, guttering and carpentry touch-ups.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>
<div data-ux="marquee" class="ux-strip" style="overflow:hidden;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);padding:15px 0;background:#0b0d10"><div style="display:flex;gap:2.4rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:13.5px;color:#99a1ae;white-space:nowrap"><span>Bathrooms</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc-hi,#e08b3c)">·</span><span>Flooring</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc-hi,#e08b3c)">·</span><span>Decks &amp; Pergolas</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc-hi,#e08b3c)">·</span><span>Extensions</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc-hi,#e08b3c)">·</span><span>Kitchen Installs</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc-hi,#e08b3c)">·</span><span>Doors &amp; Windows</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc-hi,#e08b3c)">·</span><span>Cladding</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc-hi,#e08b3c)">·</span><span>Property Maintenance</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc-hi,#e08b3c)">·</span></div></div>


<section class="sec sec--panel" id="about" aria-labelledby="a-t">
  <div class="inner">
  <p class="kick" aria-hidden="true">About</p>
  <h2 class="h2" id="a-t">The precision of a joiner,<br>the discipline of a building site</h2>
  <div class="about">
    <div class="about__art rv">
      <canvas id="jointCanvas" width="560" height="300" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
      <p class="about__cap">// LAP JOINT DETAIL — stud to plate, glued and screwed</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="about__lis">
      <li class="rv">Every job gets the same layout lines, tolerance checks and pride in a tight joint — from a bathroom strip-out to a deck frame, a kitchen fit-off to a full extension.</li>
      <li class="rv">Working clean is non-negotiable: dust sheets down, site protected, finish left ready for the next trade.</li>
      <li class="rv">Clear scopes before work starts — you know what is being built, with what materials, and what it will take.</li>
      <li class="rv">Local to Newcastle. Owner-operator, on the tools, accountable for the finish.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="areas" aria-labelledby="ar-t">
  <p class="kick" aria-hidden="true">Service area</p>
  <h2 class="h2" id="ar-t">Newcastle &amp; surrounds</h2>
  <p class="lead">Based in Newcastle and working across the wider region for residential and light commercial projects.</p>
  <div class="areas" aria-label="Service areas">
    <span class="rv">Newcastle</span><span class="rv">Lake Macquarie</span><span class="rv">Port Stephens</span><span class="rv">Maitland</span><span class="rv">Hunter Valley</span>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="foot">
  <div>
    <h3>JKB Building &amp; Carpentry</h3>
    <p>Building &amp; carpentry — Newcastle NSW.<br>Phone <a href="tel:+61422418382">0422 418 382</a></p>
